OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to raise #400k to upgrade
OL,4,Adefibrillators
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn appeal has been launched to raise
OL,7,F#400,000 to replace and upgrade 288
OL,8,Fdefibrillators to help provide
OL,9,Flife-saving care.
OL,11,FThe South Western Ambulance Charity
OL,12,F(SWAC), which covers parts of the west
OL,13,Fof England, wants to replace the
OL,14,Fcurrent defibrillators used by local
OL,15,Fvolunteers with new, up-to-date models.
OL,17,FThe devices are carried by Community
OL,18,FFirst Responders, who are trained to
OL,19,Fprovide immediate assistance in their
OL,20,Flocal, often rural, communities and can
OL,21,Foften reach patients before an
OL,22,Fambulance arrives.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
